### MCP Workflow

1. Start with `get_overview(repo="all")` or `get_overview(repo="<alias>")`.
2. Use `search_codebase(query="...", repo="all")` for discovery.
3. Use `get_context(targets=[...], repo="<alias>")` before editing unfamiliar files.
4. Use `get_risk(targets=[...], repo="<alias>")` before changing hotspots.
5. Treat `get_dead_code()` as optional cleanup guidance, not deletion authority.
